WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.924
Adult AED application — steps 1–10.

00:00:02.924 --> 00:00:03.091
1.

00:00:03.091 --> 00:00:06.683
Keep compressions going as the AED arrives.

00:00:06.683 --> 00:00:06.850
2.

00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:08.019
Open the case.

00:00:08.019 --> 00:00:08.186
3.

00:00:08.186 --> 00:00:09.690
Switch on the AED.

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:09.857
4.

00:00:09.857 --> 00:00:11.277
Expose the chest.

00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:11.444
5.

00:00:11.444 --> 00:00:16.373
Make the chest and surroundings ready for safe pad contact.

00:00:16.373 --> 00:00:16.540
6.

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:19.881
Open the pads and follow their pictures.

00:00:19.881 --> 00:00:20.048
7.

00:00:20.048 --> 00:00:23.974
Place the right pad below the right collarbone.

00:00:23.974 --> 00:00:24.141
8.

00:00:24.141 --> 00:00:28.569
Place the left pad below and left of the left nipple.

00:00:28.569 --> 00:00:28.736
9.

00:00:28.736 --> 00:00:32.829
Plug in the connector if it is not pre-connected.

00:00:32.829 --> 00:00:33.079
10.

00:00:33.079 --> 00:00:40.681
Stop contact only when the AED announces analysis, spread your arms and state ‘Stay Clear’.
